<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75503" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρχος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a row of vines</i> or
				<i>fruit-trees,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρὰ νείατον ὄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					7.127
				</span></i>
			, cf. 
			<i><span class="en">
				24.341
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				296
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρχους ἐπέκειρεν
			ὀδόντι,</span> of a boar, <i><span class="en">
				B.
				5.108
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμπελίδος ὄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					995
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμερίδων ὄρχους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.1389
				</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				 ii 23
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ὀρθῶς τοὺς ὄ. ἐφύτευσεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					20.3
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυτεύουσι . . αὐτὸ κατ᾽ ὄρχους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					4.4.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρχός,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταρσός</span>
			, <i>rim of eyelid,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.69
			</span></i>. (Wrongly derived by Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				1.48
			</span></i> from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρύσσω</span> and glossed by
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόθρος.</span>)</div>
